---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import '../styles/service-pricing.css';
const { development } = site.pricing;
---
<div class="service-price-single">
  <article class="service-price" aria-labelledby="development-title">
    <div class="service-price-heading"><div><p class="service-price-for">お店のWeb・アプリを、この1プランで。</p><h3 id="development-title">{development.name}</h3></div><Icon name="web" size={36} /></div>
    <p class="service-price-contract">{development.priceMessage}</p>
    <p class="service-price-scope">{development.basePriceScope}</p>
    <div class="service-price-columns">
      <div>
        <p class="service-price-caption">2か月目から</p>
        <p class="service-price-number"><span>月額</span><strong>{development.monthlyLabel}</strong><span>円（税込）</span></p>
        <p class="service-price-initial">初期費用 <strong>{development.initialLabel}<small>円</small></strong></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="service-price-trial"><strong>基本プランは0円で、1か月お試し。</strong><p>{development.firstMonth}</p></div>
        <div class="service-price-upgrade"><strong>データベースのアップグレード</strong><p>アップグレードする場合は、別途<strong>月額{development.databaseUpgradeMonthlyLabel}円（税込）</strong>がかかります。</p><p>2か月目以降のアップグレード時：月額{development.upgradedMonthlyLabel}円（税込）</p></div>
        <p class="service-price-customization">運用中の追加カスタマイズは別途お見積もり。制作したサイト・アプリの問題や不具合は無料で修正します。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/pricing/#development">お試し・月額料金の詳しい案内</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
